#: ../../configuration.rst:9
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: ../../configuration.rst:11
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The connector reads its configuration from three places. The file "
":file:`/etc/asm-connections.json` holds the Apple School Manager accounts"
" and the schools that the connector synchronizes to each of them. The app"
" settings in the :term:`App Center` hold the synchronization schedule and"
" a few switches for everyday operation. The :term:`UCR` holds the "
"settings that control which users the connector exports and how it maps "
"their attributes."
msgstr ""
"Der Connector liest seine Konfiguration aus zwei Quellen. Die App-"
"Einstellungen im :term:`App Center` enthalten die Einstellungen, die Sie "
"für den täglichen Betrieb benötigen, etwa die Zugangsdaten und den "
"Zeitplan der Synchronisation. Die :term:`UCR` enthält die Einstellungen, "
"die steuern, welche Benutzer der Connector exportiert und wie er ihre "
"Attribute abbildet."

#: ../../configuration.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid "Apple School Manager accounts"
msgstr "App-Einstellungen des Apple School Manager Connector"

#: ../../configuration.rst:24
msgid ""
"The connector uploads to every Apple School Manager account that is "
"listed in :file:`/etc/asm-connections.json`. Usually that is a single "
"account. If the schools on your UCS\\@school system belong to different "
"institutions, each with its own Apple School Manager account, list one "
"entry per account. The connector then uploads a separate archive to every"
" account, each restricted to the schools that you assign to that account."
msgstr ""

